 고객님께서 관리하기 힘든 부분까지 케어하겠습니다.\n\n2. 의뢰받지 않은 매물을 허위로 광고하지 않겠습니다.\n\n3. 고객님의 중개뿐만 아니라 세무 상담부터 재건축 법률 관련하여 최고의 컨설팅을 제공하겠습니다.\n\n 다양한 매물 보유하고 있습니다.\n언제든 전화 주시면 더욱 상세히 상담해 드리겠습니다.\n\n경남원베일리 공인중개사사무소\n원베일리스퀘어 1층 146호 \n\n☎ 0 2 - 5 9 2 - 0 0 7 7\n☎ 0 1 0 - 8 9 4 3 - 4 5 7 0","addr":"서울시 서초구 반포대로 333","jibun":"서울시 서초구 반포동 1","lat":37.5068,"lng":126.998185,"imgs":["https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/c3ba99d3-4bf2-4937-87d3-dc5c775b2ec1","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/47756d9e-ebda-42f7-8b26-47168a8ca5ba","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/2f259843-e13b-49a6-86fa-acdc0e5ab6bb","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/cdfcf8c5-224b-4542-97e9-cd75bf8af014","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/4d8df532-3450-4eeb-aada-2122826d37bd","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/ccf7157b-df94-47a9-bd79-a9686a8de6be","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/0840f67e-f6ef-400e-8b78-53ac4bed2f6a","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/c7f9ad3c-665f-4461-b773-5ae44d22f636","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/b15b74ba-606c-48b2-9bfd-b31ecd01ef0e","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/06a55261-9c7e-41fd-9fe1-13077ef4dbce","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/c7175c0b-e8c1-4396-a6cf-2ab5e8c12fe5","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/edbbdacb-b995-4788-95e4-a2ffc73bfac1","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/4085a167-87a5-471d-962f-2d65f7da98e6","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/2228dc55-7206-481d-9242-c058fdf7ed37"],"facts":[["Exclusive size","168.94 m²"],["Supply size","222.51 m²"],["Rooms",5],["Bathrooms",3],["Floor","중층 of 16층"],["Facing","북동"],["Layout","계단식"],["Parking","가능, 1.82 per unit"],["Move in","즉시 입주"],["Maintenance","65만원"],["Approved","2023.08.30"],["Households",2990],["Posted","2026.10.08"]],"opts":["천장형","신발장","샤워부스","욕조","싱크대","식기세척기","인덕션","붙박이장","베란다"],"tags":["주차","보안/안전"],"near":[["신반포중학교","228 m"],["세화여자중학교","636 m"],["반포중학교","651 m"],["청담고등학교","759 m"]],"link":["Dabang","https: